***REMOVED*** k8s secrets — copy to .env, fill values, then run:
***REMOVED*** make k3s-secrets
***REMOVED***
***REMOVED*** The same k8s/secrets/.env file is used to generate both:
***REMOVED*** - api-keys (all entries except POSTGRES_PASSWORD)
***REMOVED*** - db-credentials (POSTGRES_PASSWORD + fixed postgres user/db)

***REMOVED*** ─── API Keys ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

***REMOVED*** Bot & LLM providers
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=          ***REMOVED*** litellm, bot
CEREBRAS_API_KEY=
GROQ_API_KEY=
OPENAI_API_KEY=
LITELLM_MASTER_KEY=

***REMOVED*** Voice / LiveKit
LIVEKIT_API_KEY=            ***REMOVED*** livekit-sip, voice-agent
LIVEKIT_API_SECRET=         ***REMOVED*** livekit-server, livekit-sip, voice-agent
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=         ***REMOVED*** voice-agent

***REMOVED*** ─── Langfuse (ML observability) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
LANGFUSE_PUBLIC_KEY=
LANGFUSE_SECRET_KEY=
LANGFUSE_HOST=
CLICKHOUSE_PASSWORD=         ***REMOVED*** langfuse, langfuse-worker
MINIO_ROOT_PASSWORD=         ***REMOVED*** langfuse-worker, langfuse
LANGFUSE_REDIS_PASSWORD=    ***REMOVED*** langfuse, langfuse-worker
NEXTAUTH_SECRET=            ***REMOVED*** langfuse
SALT=                       ***REMOVED*** langfuse
ENCRYPTION_KEY=             ***REMOVED*** langfuse

***REMOVED*** ─── CRM (Kommo) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
KOMMO_ACCESS_TOKEN=
KOMMO_CLIENT_ID=
KOMMO_CLIENT_SECRET=

***REMOVED*** ─── Infrastructure ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
REDIS_PASSWORD=
